      "source": "In this case, an app can create an [`MPSImage`](mpsimage.md) object from a pre-allocated texture by calling this method.",
      "normalizedSource": "In this case, an app can create an [`MPSImage`](mpsimage.md) object from a pre-allocated texture by calling this method.",
