      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0011",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The [`textureType`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/MTLTexture/textureType) property of the given texture can be of type [`MTLTextureType.type2D`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/MTLTextureType/type2D) *only* if `featureChannels<=4` (meaning that `numberOfImages=1`).",
      "normalizedSource": "The [`textureType`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/MTLTexture/textureType) property of the given texture can be of type [`MTLTextureType.type2D`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/MTLTextureType/type2D) *only* if `featureChannels<=4` (meaning that `numberOfImages=1`).",
      "sourceHash": "b4aee78f33982325966a09df85157891f244ffc1ca6fe9014889b6385a162f91",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "In this case, an app can create an [`MPSImage`](mpsimage.md) object from a pre-allocated texture by calling this method.",
      "contextAfter": "Otherwise, the texture type should be [`MTLTextureType.type2DArray`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/MTLTextureType/type2DArray) with the [`arrayLength`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/MTLTexture/arrayLength) property of the given texture being equal to `numberOfImages*((featureChannels+3)/4)`.",
      "documentTitle": "init(texture:featureChannels:)",
      "framework": "MetalPerformanceShaders",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
